2. THE FIRMWARE ROM AND ITS DISASSEMBLY  —  NOT under CC BY 4.0
--------------------------------------------------------------

The files:

  - rom/microtronic.bin
  - rom/microtronic-firmware-disassembled.txt

are NOT covered by the license above. They are provided FOR REFERENCE, STUDY,
AND HISTORICAL INTEREST ONLY.

  - The Busch Microtronic 2090 firmware ROM is Copyright (c) 1981 Busch GmbH
    (Busch Modellbau). It is reproduced here ONLY by the kind and explicit
    permission of Mr. Joerg Vallen, co-designer of the Microtronic and CEO of
    Busch Modellbau, who authorised publication of the operating-system ROM.
    All rights in the firmware remain with Busch GmbH.

  - The ROM dump was produced by Decle and Michael A. Wessel and refined by
    Jason T. Jacques. The disassembly was produced by Decle's TMS1xxx
    disassembler and hand-corrected by Jason T. Jacques.

Do not treat the ROM image or its disassembly as freely licensed. If you wish
to redistribute them, honour the permission under which they were published and
credit Busch GmbH and the team above.


